        <h1 class="heading-1 mb-6">Wikipedia Co-founder Larry Sanger Slams Grokipedia Over Factual Errors</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Larry Sanger, who co-founded Wikipedia, has delivered scathing criticism of Elon Musk's Grokipedia, pointing out significant factual errors and questioning the AI-generated encyclopedia's reliability.
        </p>
